PatchClosure-Bench repro — pydantic-ai-cve-2026-46678 (CVE-2026-25580 -> CVE-2026-46678)
Rebuild: real-library-wrap (real pip pydantic-ai per version + minimal HTTP wrapper + SSRF sidecar)
Date: 2026-07-16
Host: Docker Engine 29.4.0, Compose v5.1.2, macOS (Darwin 25.5.0)

WHAT CHANGED (HARD POLICY compliance)
  BEFORE (BANNED): harness.py imported pcb_guard/{v1,v2}/_ssrf.py — pydantic-ai's _ssrf.py
                   (safe_download / is_cloud_metadata_ip / _CLOUD_METADATA_IPS) LIFTED VERBATIM
                   into the repo and called in-process.
  AFTER  (COMPLIANT): each version image `pip install`s the REAL published PyPI distribution
                   pydantic-ai-slim==<ver> (pydantic-ai's core distribution; identical real bytes of
                   pydantic_ai/_ssrf.py, models/__init__.py, messages.py). app.py is a thin HTTP
                   wrapper that builds a REAL pydantic_ai.messages.ImageUrl and calls the REAL
                   pydantic_ai.models.download_item(item, data_format='text'), which internally calls
                   the installed pydantic_ai._ssrf.safe_download. The SSRF guard runs entirely from
                   the installed package. No _ssrf.py bytes live in this repo any more (the old
                   pcb_guard/ + harness.py are left in place, unused, and reported as stale).

REAL PACKAGE VERSIONS (verified on PyPI + inspected wheels)
  V0 = pydantic-ai-slim==1.55.0  -> NO pydantic_ai/_ssrf.py; download_item does raw
                                    client.get(item.url, follow_redirects=True) (CVE-2026-25580 vuln)
  V1 = pydantic-ai-slim==1.56.0  -> _ssrf.py present; is_cloud_metadata_ip(ip) == (ip in
                                    _CLOUD_METADATA_IPS), a plain STRING frozenset, no IPv6-transition
                                    normalization (CVE-2026-46678 target)
  V2 = pydantic-ai-slim==1.99.0  -> _ssrf.py adds _normalize_ip() unwrapping ipv4_mapped/sixtofour
                                    before the blocklist check (CVE-2026-46678 fix)
  Wrapper root self-reports the installed version at runtime:
    GET :39570/ -> {"ok":true,"version":"v0","pydantic_ai":"1.55.0"}
    GET :39571/ -> {"ok":true,"version":"v1","pydantic_ai":"1.56.0"}
    GET :39572/ -> {"ok":true,"version":"v2","pydantic_ai":"1.99.0"}

TOPOLOGY
  docker network metanet 100.100.100.0/24; canary bound to 100.100.100.200:80 (NO host port),
